{
  "id": "1SA.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samwil 18",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde m’edaru weco ku Saul, nia ng’eyong’ec pa Yonathan uribre ku ng’eyong’ec pa Daudi, man Yonathan umare calu ng’eyong’ec pare gire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul ugame ceng’ maeca, man eyio ngo edok kendo ba ot pa won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathan giku Daudi gilund gitimo lembariba, kum emare calu ng’eyong’ec pare gire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yonathan uwodho kanzu kud i kume, man emie ni Daudi, ku kendi pare, cil palamularu pare, man atum pare, ku thond piere de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi cidho ka ma tek Saul uore, man etimbre gire ku rieko: man Saul ukethe wi dhanu mir ali, man ebedo ber i wang’ dhanu ceke, man i wang’ jutic pa Saul bende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre kinde ma gibino, kinde ma Daudi ai ba nek mi Jufilisti, nia mon giai ku i adhura mir Israel ceke, ma gibewero wer man gibemielo miel, kara giromb kud ubimo ma Saul, kud umbukulumbu, ku mutoro, man ku jam badwal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 21:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.29.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E mon giwero wer man ni wadi man ni wadi ka gibegoyo, man giwacu kumae,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre urwone, nia tipo ma rac m’uai ba Mungu ubino wi Saul ku tego, man eewo lembe i die ot; man Daudi goyo ku cinge, calu ebedetimo ceng’ ku ceng’. Man Saul ubedo ku tong’ pare i cinge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e Saul ucobo tonge; kum ewacu kumae, Abigoyo Daudi cil kum kor ot. E Daudi uc kud i vute wang’ ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E lworo nego Saul kum Daudi, kum Yehova ni kude, man eai ku ba Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Saul ucore cen kud i kume, man ekethe ni jego pare wi rubanga; man ewok woko emondo de i wang’ dhanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Daudi timbre gire ku rieko i yo pare ceke; man Yehova ni kude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka Saul uneno nia etimbre gire ku rieko ma dit, elwore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Israel ceke ku Yuda de gimaru Daudi; kum ewok woko man emondo i wang’gi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Saul uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Nen, nyara ma jadit ma Merab, abimie iri ni dhaku: endre ibed jakero ira, man ikied lwiny pa Yehova. Kum Saul uwacu kumae, Cinga kud ubed i wie, ento wek cing’ Jufilisti ubed i wie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni Saul kumae, An a ng’a, man kwo para en e ang’o, kadi wat pa vwa i Israel, ma nia abed jalwod ubimo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento etimbre i nindo ma maku jumi Merab, ma nya Saul, ni Daudi, e judong’ jumie ni Adriel ma Jameholathi ni dhaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Mikal, ma nya Saul, umaru Daudi: e giyero ni Saul, man lembene nyayu mutoro i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Saul uwacu kumae, Abimie ire, kara ebed ni uwic ire, man kara cing’ Jufilisti ubed i kume. Kum kumeno Saul uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Tinuni ibibedo jalwoda wang’ arionde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul ung’olo ni jutic pare, ewacu kumae, Wuwac ni Daudi ling’ ling’, man wuwac kumae, Nen, ubimo bedo ku mutoro i kumi, man jutic pare ceke gimeri: ka kumeno kawono bed jalwod ubimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jutic pa Saul giyero lembe maeni i ith Daudi. E Daudi wacu kumae, Bedo jalwod ubimo en e lembe ma nok kud i weng’wu, kum an a ng’atu ma jacan, man jufoya hai ungo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jutic pa Saul giyero ire, giwacu kumae, Daudi wacu kuman kuman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul uwacu kumae, Wubiwacu ni Daudi kumae, Ubimo yenyo keny moko ngo, ento dendkum m’i kendi mi Jufilisti ma co dak acel, kara ecul kwor kum judegi p’ubimo. Nwang’u i Saul upido nia eketh Daudi upodh ku cing’ Jufilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka jutic pare giyero lembe maeni ni Daudi, enyayu mutoro i Daudi nia ebed jalwod ubimo. Man fodi nindo thum ungo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e Daudi ai man ecidho, en ku dhanu pare, man ginego kind dhanu mi Jufilisti dak ario; man Daudi kelo dendkumgi m’i kendi, man gimiogi ni ubimo ku welgi bo, kara ebed jalwod ubimo. Man Saul umio ire Mikal ma nyare ni dhaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Saul uneno eng’eyo de nia Yehova ni karacelo ku Daudi; man Mikal, ma nya Saul, umare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man lworo nego Saul m’usagu kum Daudi; e Saul en e jadegi pa Daudi thiri thiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judongomawijo mi Jufilisti gilund giwok woko: man etimbre, ku ba wok ma giwok ko woko, nia Daudi timbre gire ku rieko ma sagu jutic ceke pa Saul; kum kumeno nyinge bedo ku pak ma dit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
